0..47 Comment "//! This source models string receiver methods."
48..51 Comment "//!"
52..131 Comment "//! A receiver mode controls each method call. The mode prevents invalid reads,"
132..153 Comment "//! writes and takes."
154..157 Comment "//!"
158..231 Comment "//! `Str` implements read, write and consumed methods. A call follows its"
232..250 Comment "//! receiver hold."
